    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This source file contains the implementation of the <computeroutput>counters::operator+=</computeroutput> member function, which aggregates test result counters from one <computeroutput>counters</computeroutput> instance into another. It accumulates passed checks, failed checks, and the executed, failed, and skipped test cases.</para>
<para>All definitions reside within the <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacemicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus" kindref="compound">micro_os_plus::micro_test_plus</ref></computeroutput> namespace.</para>
<para>This file must be included when building the µTest++ library. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
